The Substance of all banana is not banana shaped! However, the
Unique banana is like the Substance of all banana, except that it
is banana shaped (and generally has the properties of a banana).

This is not a complete solution, though, because although two
things shapes like a banana both have the property of being
banana-shaped, they do not necessarily have identical shapes.

My solution: "each thing is such that if category-membership
were decided by shape alone, then it would be a banana", "It
is shaped as though it were a banana".

